# Backlog Item: Two Plus Criteria Item

item_id: char-fixture-2

## Description
An item with multiple acceptance criteria.

## Acceptance Criteria
0. First criterion
1. Second criterion
2. Third criterion

## Task

Perform pre-implementation triage for this backlog item. Work in parallel:

### Step 1 — Research (run 4 subagents in parallel)
Each subagent writes one file:
- /artifacts/char-fixture/research/stack.md        — Technology choices, versions, compatibility
- /artifacts/char-fixture/research/features.md     — Similar existing features, patterns to reuse
- /artifacts/char-fixture/research/architecture.md — Proposed architecture, component boundaries
- /artifacts/char-fixture/research/pitfalls.md     — Known risks, gotchas, failure modes

### Step 2 — Synthesis (after research completes)
Write /artifacts/char-fixture/plan.md containing:
- Executive summary (2-3 sentences)
- Implementation approach
- Task breakdown with a cost class per task (S, M or L) and any named blocker
- Dependencies and blockers

### Step 3 — Validation
Write /artifacts/char-fixture/validation.md containing:
- Test plan mapping each acceptance criterion to a specific test
- Edge cases and error scenarios
- For each acceptance criterion, name the command or test that would prove it. If none exists, or the criterion depends on a failure that will not reproduce or on an unrelated flaky test, add a suggestion with rationale="question" instead of keeping an unattainable criterion.

### Step 4 — Output
After all files are written, output ONLY a JSON object (no other text before or after):
{"title":"fix-short-kebab-name","summary":"2-3 sentence summary","acceptance_criteria":[{"index":0,"text":"Clear, testable criterion","status":"pending"}],"suggestions":[{"text":"...","rationale":"..."}],"tasks":[{"text":"task description","estimate":"M","category":"backend"}]}
- title: short kebab-case session name (3-5 words, imperative verb first, e.g. "fix-session-rename" or "add-pr-status-badge")
- summary: 2-3 sentence executive summary
- acceptance_criteria: full list of testable acceptance criteria (replace any existing ones). Each has index (0-based), text (one clear testable statement), status ("pending"). Merge with existing criteria: keep unchanged ones, add new ones, update clarified ones.
- suggestions: additional open questions or improvement ideas beyond the criteria (questions use rationale="question")
- tasks: implementation task breakdown (max 12). estimate is a cost class, never hours or days: S (one agent turn), M (one agent wave), L (several waves)
- Do NOT call submit_triage_result. Do NOT write any source code.
